      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update:\n\nToday it works again.\n\nBut WHY?\n\nIs it EAC that played a trick on me? This is annoying if it not even gives any hint what is going wrong or anything.\n\nLogs didn't show anything.\n\nOnly thing that has changed over the night would be my IP-Address because i have a 24 hour reconnect.",
