      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had this exact issue (VRChat team: support ticket #140411) on a relatively bloated Windows 10 a couple of months ago... I am almost certain my IP address had not changed in that time frame, and it worked again a week later. I also suspect it's an EAC issue, though the fact that you have it on a brand new Windows installation puzzles me as to what could possibly be triggering it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
